## Checkout Inline Billing & Address Capture

- Checkout accepts either a saved address (`addressId`) or an inline payload on finalize.
- Inline payload shape (frontend `FinalizeCartRequest.addressPayload` / backend finalize handler):
  - `shipping_city` (number, required)
  - `PostalCode` (10-digit string, required)
  - `FullAddress` (string, required)
  - `Description` (string, optional)
  - `save` (boolean, optional) — when `false`, the created address is marked `IsTemporary` and hidden from the address book.
- Backend stores a new `IsTemporary` flag on `local-user-address`; `/local-user-addresses/me` filters `IsTemporary: false`.
- Frontend checkout UI shows:
  - Saved-address dropdown (autofills form)
  - Inline province/city selects + postal code + full address fields
  - “Save this address” toggle to persist to the address book
- Validation:
  - Requires either `addressId` or all inline fields
  - Postal code must be 10 digits
  - Phone is required; shipping method required
